Caught exception in a refresh / session catch -> "Error == Unknown or LobbyPatcher stale-index?"
"Error == Unknown or LobbyPatcher stale-index?" -> "BENIGN — swallow silently, retry next tick": yes
"Error == Unknown or LobbyPatcher stale-index?" -> "429 or RateLimited?": no
"429 or RateLimited?" -> "RATE-LIMIT — back off 2x, keep session ref": yes
"429 or RateLimited?" -> "404 or NotFound or NotInLobby?": no
"404 or NotFound or NotInLobby?" -> DEFINITE — LeavePartyKeepHost → fresh solo session + OnHostConnectionLost: yes
